    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exist.EXE is a pixel-art puzzle adventure where you play as Marcus, a game developer grieving his mother\u2019s death. He\u2019s pulled into a digital world where his programming skills can be used to hack objects and shape them. Here, hacking isn\u2019t just about solving puzzles; it\u2019s about turning heartbreaking life events into moments of joy, even if only for a moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Marcus explores this digital world, his journey becomes one of self-discovery. An AI resembling his late mother wants him to stay in this perfect digital world to escape sadness. But his best friend reminds him to stay in reality instead of getting lost in a fake perfect world.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Narrative Unfolds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter emotional scenarios where you discover you are capable of changing the world to make a difference</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deeply Personal Journey</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a digital world, Marcus embarks on a self-discovery journey to deal with his grief. He must ultimately choose between facing reality or staying in a fake, perfect world    </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Hacking-based Puzzles</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate the environment with hacking mechanics designed to be intuitive and engaging for all skill level</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282860/extras/fd8fce7a6970426197c0ab0906cef6a7.poster.avif?t=1755252433\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282860/extras/fd8fce7a6970426197c0ab0906cef6a7.webm?t=1755252433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282860/extras/fd8fce7a6970426197c0ab0906cef6a7.mp4?t=1755252433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into an Immersive Digital World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a digital world blending nostalgic pixel art with modern design elements, creating a unique aesthetic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282860/extras/83bdd210f5a276f80541d78ee3dc68ae.poster.avif?t=1755252433\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282860/extras/83bdd210f5a276f80541d78ee3dc68ae.webm?t=1755252433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282860/extras/83bdd210f5a276f80541d78ee3dc68ae.mp4?t=1755252433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design, Build, Challenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own puzzles with the in-game level editor. Share your unique creations with the community and challenge others.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282860/extras/2b3d6bfa56dee8c81745eba0f06b3f5c.poster.avif?t=1755252433\" width=1092 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282860/extras/2b3d6bfa56dee8c81745eba0f06b3f5c.webm?t=1755252433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282860/extras/2b3d6bfa56dee8c81745eba0f06b3f5c.mp4?t=1755252433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
